vFM Player - Optional MA3 banks

SD folder: /vFM/midi/banks/MA3

Original FITOM FMB resources. Preserve filenames. They are not standalone music files and are used only by compatible bank configurations.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/midi/banks/MA3

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
